{"t":"009540.KS","n":"HD Korea Shipbuilding & Offshore Engineering Co., Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":225000.0,"chg":11500.0,"chgPct":0.05386,"prev":213500.0,"dayH":226000.0,"dayL":215500.0,"w52H":488000.0,"w52L":212000.0,"vol":162133,"avgVol":163934,"mcap":15910792331264,"pe":null,"fpe":3.66,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":15600.0,"divY":0.0731,"beta":1.28,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Aerospace & Defense","iKo":"항공우주 및 방위","city":"Seongnam-si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.hdksoe.co.kr","sum":"HD Korea Shipbuilding & Offshore Engineering Co., Ltd. engages in shipbuilding and offshore engineering business in South Korea. The company offers ship types, including tankers, container ships, petrochemical carriers, LNG carriers, LNG-FSRUs, LPG carriers, LEG carriers, car carriers, Ro-Pax, Ro-Ro, LNG bunkering carriers, and LCO2 ships; and offshore plant business includes the manufacturing and installation of offshore structures, floating crude oil production facilities, power generation facilities, and other individual equipment units. It also specializes in building various types of special-purpose ships, such as destroyers, frigates, corvettes, logistics support ships, amphibious, minelaying, marine intelligence, surface, rescue, and training ships, support vessels, high-speed boats","sumKo":"HD코리아조선해양엔지니어링(주)는 한국에서 조선해양 엔지니어링 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 유조선, 컨테이너선, 석유화학 운반선, LNG 운반선, LNG-FSRU, LPG 운반선, LEG 운반선, 자동차 운반선, Ro-Pax, Ro-Ro, LNG 벙커링 운반선 및 LCO2 선박을 포함한 선박 유형을 제공합니다. 해양플랜트사업에는 해양구조물, 부유식 원유생산시설, 발전시설, 기타 개별설비 등을 제작, 설치하는 사업이 포함됩니다. 또한 구축함, 프리깃함, 코르벳함, 군수지원함, 수륙양용함, 기뢰부설함, 해양정보함, 수상함, 구조함, 훈련함, 지원함, 고속정 등 다양한 종류의 특수목적함 건조를 전문으로 하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":17302000000000,"ni":-216949610000},{"y":2023,"rev":21296200000000,"ni":144900000000},{"y":2024,"rev":25538600000000,"ni":1454600000000},{"y":2025,"rev":29933200000000,"ni":2928400000000}],"quarterly"